{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Solid hookup wire felt especially useful because it complements my breadboards and PCB supplies across several small circuit projects.",
    "The resistor assortment fits my circuit-building and troubleshooting needs; diodes and capacitors also make sense if their values match what I need."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Fast color-changing LEDs share the electronics connection, but their decorative behavior does not serve the practical circuits I want to build.",
    "A hundred LED holders, specialized toggle switches, and a depth gauge require specific projects I have not indicated I am doing."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My electronics purchases seem to have been taken as interest in almost any electronic component, regardless of its function.",
    "My occasional mechanical purchase seems to have been stretched into a need for specialized measuring equipment."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "I am more ready to choose reusable basics, such as hookup wire and resistors, than parts tied to a particular mounting or switching arrangement.",
    "A relevant part is not automatically something I need now: for large assortments, I would check my existing supplies and the included specifications first."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my practical electronics interests but sometimes confused a related component with something useful for my current projects."
}"}
